<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0701_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Reese</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0701_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I wasn’t feelin’ my best today, that’s\nall!\rWe should swap numbers, then we can\nscrap again! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0701_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Next time we meet, I’mma be WAY\nstronger, I promise! I’m drinkin’ milk!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0701_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You just gon’ win and DIP?\nThat’s LOW! That’s DISRESPECTFUL!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0701_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I wasn’t feelin’ my best today,\nthat’s all!\rWe should swap numbers,\nthen we can scrap again! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0701_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You came to grab a Dusk Stone?\nThis it...\rDon’t be shy! This gettin’ awkward,\nso just TAKE it already!\fI’m blushin’. Bikers don’t blush.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0701_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, now...\nAm I REALLY that scary to you?\rYou know I know you on\nCycling Road, right?\rIf you gon’ come all the way out\nhere, might as well talk in person!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0701_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">BWA HA HA HA!\nMy {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} got SO much stronger.\fYou’d be SHOOK to see it now!\rWe knocked a {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} FLAT--\nBOOM!\rAin’t NOTHIN’ scare us now...\nas long as they low-enough level!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0701_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} got stronger, but we let\na wild {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} get away!\rWhat, you think it ESCAPED us?\nNah, man! We LET it go!\fWe merciful. Like a biker monk.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0701_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We found a wild {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} by the road!\rIt jumped out and scared me so bad I\nfell over!\rDid I get hurt?\rNah--I landed on my homie, and it broke\nmy fall! My homie’s mad at me now.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0701_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Whoa...\nI can’t believe how buff I’m now.\rI’ll be showin’ off my moves on\n{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}, so come by and get\fstomped! I’ll be waitin’!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0701_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup with that?!\nDidn’t you say you was finna come\fout here and get schooled?!\rC’mon! I’m waitin’ on\n{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}, so hurry up!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0701_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">After my Biker gang showed up on\nCycling Road, the vibe got weird...\rAt least, that’s what people been\nsayin’.\rWe ain’t doin’ nothin’ mean!\rWe just challenge strong Hustlers!\nAnd hold doors. We hold doors.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0701_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I was ridin’ in the dead of night,\nand I found this thing called a\fDusk Stone!\rYou seem like somebody with a lotta\npromise, so I wanna give it to you.\rIf you want it, I’ll be waitin’ on\n{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0701_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know, I went through a LOT\nsavin’ you this Dusk Stone,\fand you don’t even want it!\rI’m on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}, so come over\nwhenever. Nah... Come over NOW!</language>
	</row>
</body>
